    "title": "POWKIDDY RK2023 Retro Handheld Video Game Console 3.5 Inch 4:3 IPS Screen RK3566 Chip with Dual Speaker",
    "body_html": "<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sBFSHCyqtOU\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AJFCJaV6fyJU1oNwoIy5gFxg8pdmuztFcwGUKrI0tRItUnBltISzX78lfcGGMIEOsOCF391pd9ioaX4wIwsz8eaue-adltb-lesWVv5B7TyYz_1jqpnb5m6NAc0NWkF6Cb-ekFV7ixieqEO9MWaa44WLDnJD=w1720-h1147-s-no?authuser=1\"></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"></span></strong>SPECIFICATIONS</p>\n<p>Type of devices: Other</p>\n<p>Touch Screen: No</p>\n<p>Supporting Language: English</p>\n<p>Screen Type: IPS</p>\n<p>Screen Resolution: 640x480</p>\n<p>Operating System: linux</p>\n<p>Material: Plastic</p>\n<p>Input/Output: HDMI</p>\n<p>HDMI: Mini HDMI</p>\n<p>Games included: 15000</p>\n<p>Games Type: PSP/PS/MAME/NEOGEO/CPS/GBA/GB/GBC/MD/SMX/DC</p>\n<p>External Controller Interface: Type-C</p>\n<p>Expandable storage: 512GB</p>\n<p>Display Size: 3.5\"</p>\n<p>Data Storage Capacity: 64G</p>\n<p>Communication: USB</p>\n<p>Color Display: Yes</p>\n<p>Charging Interface Type: Type-C</p>\n<p>Certification: CE</p>\n<p>Category: Handheld Game Players</p>\n<p>Brand Name: POWKIDDY</p>\n<p>Bluetooth-compatible: No</p>\n<p>Battery Capacity[mAh]: 3500mAh</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>RK2023 detailed parameters</p>\n<p>System: multiple open source linux<br> Game: compatible with PSP/MAME/N64/PS/CP3/NEOGEO/GBA/NES/SFC/MD/NDS and other simulators<br> Display screen: size 3.5 \"IPS OCA full fit<br> Resolution: 640 * 480<br> Main CPU: ARM four-core 1.8GHz high-performance RK3566 open-source chip<br> RAM\uff1aLPDDR4 1GB<br> External storage: TF1-OS 16GB-256GB<br> TF2-GMAE 16GB-256GB<br> Sound: built-in cavity speaker 1W * 2 stereo effect<br> Power supply: built-in lithium battery 3500mAh<br> Input power: 5V2A<br> Maximum power consumption: 5W<br> Battery life: 8 hours<br> Charging time: 2 hours<br> Interface: TYPE-C fast charging<br> TV HD display: supported<br> OTG-USB: support<br> Headphone: standard 3.5MM<br> Unique features<br> 1. Super compact shape, nostalgic<br> 2. Adopt 4:3 HD 640 * 480IPS-LCD<br> 3. Dual TF card independent system and game storage design, no need to copy the game to upgrade the system<br> 4. With high-performance quad-core CPU, FPS runs perfectly at 60HZ<br> 5. Support open source system, arbitrary upgrade, compatible with mainstream 64-bit 3D simulator<br> 6. Size 151.5 * 78 * 17.5MM (body)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8ADB-ueJ0diuWNgP9MzXjof6BDd_tf2d8Y0nwIptGAznaeyzx4d9bLWbOlmpAENhO0rgnhfRnv03NJuyM3hzY8eohHu4JhOXA3gmLIQVhhpfJKVcRzdLXxYj3nrGQRtniBaNvVXjM9SOp3-ur_xCrvV=w894-h1270-no?authuser=2\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8ALB5PKIA2taot48WVKz2umjrqGI2WvaNbsRRmeZ3-LA2SLYzB-2C3mvTTEXqJurAI_Be67xkNca0eeCa0U9aVsCII4Vg265BlZ0DCWPTtd6VAhMPdjrDAbIUpJtyS_17iOhD-U3gAiDHBSPBKPTkjP=w968-h1270-no?authuser=2\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8Aj5j4rWRSstP2nCnzGByh8-o7VP07JVnu7coNizZdqgLVwRX87TcttBD7UEqBWiU3ibnOlJwa4G0nUAGAacrJwaUxMLhCHzLQ_UlUCquvzZgAIU1t_IVJfkIgG5qo_2sPBDSkqMK5zArfIHEe3VRxj=w988-h1270-no?authuser=2\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8DU5PdJtqBXNAY5hm8iqY1MA6bNk4B4O8UHNebDEsou_pSjjx6J9QBqt8Ly7yO-pH19btgR5bqkudDrvloSYRm1LfbZVc0Pvqf_EsDSQDFNpLnz7tug5bHJlzwsMdO5QoEgCoQmFFKs3_efSFhyUp6z=w740-h1270-no?authuser=2\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8B0hzZhIKo2u_3Xow7mFlt_wkrIwfXM6mIuX3VpapdzILt2tUS0fkvPy87bcuRckDjTWJ_mGxPvHTfS96fhg_9P4y98czKJMgS0Y5yTBw_gLE86n9ydlx-IJYnGp_jMaE-CrKToF0XOfyl3yR6Dqys7=w1000-h962-no?authuser=2\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8A_iqRxTY0L9VnAVvcMCgDmfNdH7qpJleSxi4LeHAUlk4zQpXC1rLVKjRxOz7_S-QJo91j9kdWRu0mKOJa_0vzJFYhLMG_kBMVRoe_W1JvW9GJBih9Xr1ZJ1cJAMTjsbkM67-hMDQ9ADMHuzDdlnO2H=w10